{"3317920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gordak", "steam_appid": 3317920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gordak</strong> is an exploration, survival and building game where you are shipwrecked on an unknown procedurally generated island and have to settle your own village and grow your tribe through gathering resources as well as finding and recruiting other survivors. You must protect your village at all costs while also heading out into the wild to slay the undead lords of Gordak, an orc god who has plagued the island with an undead curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/6ed7f03668ca67df96a0eddd6161e31e.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/6ed7f03668ca67df96a0eddd6161e31e.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/6ed7f03668ca67df96a0eddd6161e31e.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE ISLAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island and its unique biomes for enemies to slay and resources to gather in order to build and upgrade your village. Be cautious, as some biomes might be hard to navigate unprepared. Find the traveling Merchant to buy unique items using essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/acad0437ace11ec50db46ee1a91be872.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/acad0437ace11ec50db46ee1a91be872.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/acad0437ace11ec50db46ee1a91be872.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT AND SURVIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay everything in your way to becoming the strongest war chief the island has ever known. There are various melee options available as well as using bows or magical staffs with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/d625faebc40b8fd5d216109d86a9c818.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/d625faebc40b8fd5d216109d86a9c818.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/d625faebc40b8fd5d216109d86a9c818.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DAY/NIGHT AND WEATHER SYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for food, gather resources and upgrade your village during the hours of the day. The night brings new challenges and creatures that makes navigating the island all the more difficult. Some weather events such as rain and mist could lead to nighttime challenges creeping into daylight hours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/6a654191434de7018522f3342915ec68.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/6a654191434de7018522f3342915ec68.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/6a654191434de7018522f3342915ec68.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/2dbcb714c311648b5ad6f36a2b5fbbc5.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/2dbcb714c311648b5ad6f36a2b5fbbc5.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/2dbcb714c311648b5ad6f36a2b5fbbc5.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GATHER RESOURCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood with your trusty axe and mine stone and other ores with your hammer, although some resources will require stronger weapons. Climbing the surrounding mountains will lead you to find better and more resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/a244f0e48799df33028e9f85306b1d57.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/a244f0e48799df33028e9f85306b1d57.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/a244f0e48799df33028e9f85306b1d57.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD AND UPGRADE YOUR VILLAGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After settling your village, the undead will be drawn to the sent of new life. Make sure to set up a strong perimeter around your village. Build defensive towers, garrisons, walls and more to assure the safety of the tribe. Acquire villagers and warriors to aid you in resisting the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/9a29f6d3bc074f8a7fbe73dba2a8b2dd.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/9a29f6d3bc074f8a7fbe73dba2a8b2dd.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/9a29f6d3bc074f8a7fbe73dba2a8b2dd.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally-generated island. Biomes are immersive and distinct, with a focus on their own abundance or lack of resources and enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player experience which can be replayed unlimited times, giving a new experience every time. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base building system where you construct your village around the village center. A range of resource, defensive and other unique structures are available to grow the strength of your tribe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying progression system. Every time one of the 3 undead lords are slain the player becomes more powerful, while the island becomes more hostile and difficult to navigate as well as fauna becoming increasingly scarce. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system allowing the player to craft basic equipment from his inventory, advanced equipment from the forge as well as unique equipment using the essence of fallen undead lords at the tribe's altar of Gordak.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorbing essence from fallen undead enemies can be used to purchase items, craft unique equipment and construct crucial structures for the village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging and unique boss fights that will test not just your level of equipment, but your skill as well.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night system coupled with weather events. Nighttime come with increased difficulty with new dangerous creatures roaming around.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gordak</strong> is an exploration, survival and building game where you are shipwrecked on an unknown procedurally generated island and have to settle your own village and grow your tribe through gathering resources as well as finding and recruiting other survivors. You must protect your village at all costs while also heading out into the wild to slay the undead lords of Gordak, an orc god who has plagued the island with an undead curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/6ed7f03668ca67df96a0eddd6161e31e.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/6ed7f03668ca67df96a0eddd6161e31e.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/6ed7f03668ca67df96a0eddd6161e31e.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE ISLAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island and its unique biomes for enemies to slay and resources to gather in order to build and upgrade your village. Be cautious, as some biomes might be hard to navigate unprepared. Find the traveling Merchant to buy unique items using essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/acad0437ace11ec50db46ee1a91be872.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/acad0437ace11ec50db46ee1a91be872.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/acad0437ace11ec50db46ee1a91be872.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT AND SURVIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay everything in your way to becoming the strongest war chief the island has ever known. There are various melee options available as well as using bows or magical staffs with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/d625faebc40b8fd5d216109d86a9c818.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/d625faebc40b8fd5d216109d86a9c818.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/d625faebc40b8fd5d216109d86a9c818.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DAY/NIGHT AND WEATHER SYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for food, gather resources and upgrade your village during the hours of the day. The night brings new challenges and creatures that makes navigating the island all the more difficult. Some weather events such as rain and mist could lead to nighttime challenges creeping into daylight hours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/6a654191434de7018522f3342915ec68.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/6a654191434de7018522f3342915ec68.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/6a654191434de7018522f3342915ec68.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/2dbcb714c311648b5ad6f36a2b5fbbc5.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/2dbcb714c311648b5ad6f36a2b5fbbc5.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/2dbcb714c311648b5ad6f36a2b5fbbc5.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GATHER RESOURCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood with your trusty axe and mine stone and other ores with your hammer, although some resources will require stronger weapons. Climbing the surrounding mountains will lead you to find better and more resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/a244f0e48799df33028e9f85306b1d57.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/a244f0e48799df33028e9f85306b1d57.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/a244f0e48799df33028e9f85306b1d57.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD AND UPGRADE YOUR VILLAGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After settling your village, the undead will be drawn to the sent of new life. Make sure to set up a strong perimeter around your village. Build defensive towers, garrisons, walls and more to assure the safety of the tribe. Acquire villagers and warriors to aid you in resisting the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/9a29f6d3bc074f8a7fbe73dba2a8b2dd.poster.avif?t=1787840758\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/9a29f6d3bc074f8a7fbe73dba2a8b2dd.webm?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/extras/9a29f6d3bc074f8a7fbe73dba2a8b2dd.mp4?t=1787840758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally-generated island. Biomes are immersive and distinct, with a focus on their own abundance or lack of resources and enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player experience which can be replayed unlimited times, giving a new experience every time. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base building system where you construct your village around the village center. A range of resource, defensive and other unique structures are available to grow the strength of your tribe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying progression system. Every time one of the 3 undead lords are slain the player becomes more powerful, while the island becomes more hostile and difficult to navigate as well as fauna becoming increasingly scarce. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system allowing the player to craft basic equipment from his inventory, advanced equipment from the forge as well as unique equipment using the essence of fallen undead lords at the tribe's altar of Gordak.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorbing essence from fallen undead enemies can be used to purchase items, craft unique equipment and construct crucial structures for the village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging and unique boss fights that will test not just your level of equipment, but your skill as well.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night system coupled with weather events. Nighttime come with increased difficulty with new dangerous creatures roaming around.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A savage exploration and survival game. Build and defend your village, grow your tribe and slay the undead lords to remove the influence of the orc god, Gordak, in order to lift the undead plague.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317920/6c55